Suggests: vulkan-tools
Description: Vulkan post-processing layer with overlay UI
 VKIntox is a Vulkan layer that adds ReShade-compatible post-processing effects,
 depth buffer resolve, and an in-game Material 3 overlay on Wayland and X11.
